          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "三、解答题:本题共8小题，每小题5分，请考生在22、23题中选择一题，并在答题纸上涂黑，不涂黑、多涂或多答均按第一题评分."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.045,
            0.595,
            0.328,
            0.635
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "17. (1) 计算: "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(x + 1)(x - 1) + x(2 - x)."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (2) 解不等式组: "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} 4x - 3 > 9, \\\\ 2 + x \\geqslant 0 \\end{array} \\right."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.045,
            0.643,
            0.455,
            0.704
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "[答案]:【小问1详解】解:原式 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "=x^{2}-1+2x-x^{2}=2x-1;"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 【小问2详解】解: "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} 4x - 3 > 9(1) \\\\ 2 + x \\geqslant 0(2) \\end{array} \\right."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，解不等式(1)，得 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "x > 3 ,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 解不等式(2),得x≥-2,所以原不等式组的解是 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "x > 3 ."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " [解析]:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.045,
            0.708,
            0.454,
            0.744
          ],
          "content": [
